Subject: [PATCH 10/10] feat(gerege): operator CLI - modules
 list/enable/disable/new

Phase 3 tooling: 'gerege modules list' (public or admin detail),
'enable/disable <id>' against the runtime admin API, and 'new <id>'
scaffolding a valid modules/<id>/module.go skeleton with a follow-up
checklist. Testable core in cmd/gerege/cli with httptest-backed API
tests and a parser-verified scaffold test.
